        "description": "Positive family history consistent with autosomal dominant inheritance",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of thrombocytopenia with large platelets plus identification of a pathogenic MYH9 mutation",
    "notes": "Diagnosis is confirmed by genetic testing; inclusion bodies and family history support diagnosis."
